config IMSIC
	bool "RISC-V Incoming MSI Controller (IMSIC)"
	default y
	depends on RISCV_HAS_IMSIC
	help
	  RISC-V Incoming MSI Controller (IMSIC) is a per-hart module that
	  receives and records incoming message-signaled interrupts (MSIs).
	  It signals to the hart when there are pending and enabled interrupts 
	  to be serviced.